{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XigFrB19nx27axb81mFfFc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":831,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(feat) Add date range filter to bills table\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"NethmiRodrigo\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-10T12:19:32.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-09-17T15:13:13.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-09-17T15:13:13.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/831\",\"mergeCommit\":\"6e4cdcd9db634a947b317df793d5b8170a9768e9\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-31T16:10:56.382Z\",\"tickets\":[],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"6e4cdcd9db634a947b317df793d5b8170a9768e9\",\"source\":\"merge-commit-sha\",\"verified\":true}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/billing.resource.test.ts\",\"additions\":81,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/billing.resource.ts\",\"additions\":21,\"deletions\":4},{\"path\":\"src/bills-table/bills-table.component.tsx\",\"additions\":54,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"src/bills-table/bills-table.scss\",\"additions\":15,\"deletions\":0},{\"path\":\"src/bills-table/bills-table.test.tsx\",\"additions\":146,\"deletions\":5},{\"path\":\"src/routes.json\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1},{\"path\":\"translations/en.json\",\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":0}],\"body\":\"## Requirements\\n\\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/en-US/docs/frontend-modules/contributing/#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\\n\\n## Summary\\n<!-- Please describe what problems your PR addresses. -->\\n\\nAdds From and To date pickers to the bills table on the Billing home page so cashiers can narrow the list to bills created in a given period. The dates are sent as the `startDate` and `endDate` search parameters on `GET /billing/bill`, which the billing backend added in openmrs/openmrs-module-billing#193.\\n\\n- `usePaginatedBills` appends `startDate` (start of day) and `endDate` (end of day) to the URL when set.\\n- The From picker is capped by the To date and the To picker floored by the From date. When a typed range is inverted, `usePaginatedBills` passes a `null` URL so no request is made (the backend would return a 400); the To picker shows an invalid message and the table shows the \\\"No matching bills\\\" state.\\n- A Clear dates button appears once a date is set and resets both dates.\\n- The `billing` backend dependency floor in `routes.json` is raised to `>=2.5.0-0`, the first version with the new search parameters.\\n\\n## Screenshots\\n<!-- Required if you are making UI changes. -->\\n\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6822335b-af02-4bcb-a0f8-03dde54c33cb\\n\\n\\n\\n## Related Issue\\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira ticket here if one exists. -->\\n<!-- https://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3- -->\\n\\n## Other\\n<!-- Anything not covered above -->\\n\\nTwo standalone `OpenmrsDatePicker`s are used rather than `OpenmrsDateRangePicker` because the filter needs to support open-ended ranges (only a From date, or only a To date). The range picker only emits a value once both ends are set.\\n\\n\",\"freshness\":[{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"lastSyncedAt\":\"2026-10-31T16:10:56.382Z\",\"stale\":false}],\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92f654a5-a7f9-410d-93e5-f42be1f01479","uuid":"9075bb18-4136-44c7-8dfb-9c38b6c28d8d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T16:24:22.195Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":831,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"t