moved `closeModal()` calls from the approve/reject/delete success paths; the modal now stays open and refreshes in place via `useBill` + SWR mutate\\r\\n- **Add `mapProperties` param to `useBill`**: extended the hook with an overloaded signature so the modal can fetch the raw `PatientInvoice` (needed for `useReviewBillModel`) without triggering property mapping\\r\\n- **Disable all action buttons while busy**: changed `disabled={busy === d.uuid}` to `disabled={!!busy}` across all discount card action buttons so no concurrent actions can be triggered while one is in flight\\r\\n- **Show progress bar during loading/validating/busy**: the modal body is replaced with a `ProgressBar` while `isLoading`, `isValidating`, or `busy` is truthy, preventing stale data from rendering between an action completing and the revalidation settling (`localMutate` is awaited to keep `busy` truthy for the full round-trip)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Screenshots\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2dfc4ed-f36f-4237-a0a4-159ee115769d\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n## Related Issue\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5708\\r\\n\\r\\n## Other\\r\\n\\r\\n<!-- Anything not covered above -->\",\"freshness\":[{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"lastSyncedAt\":\"2026-10-31T16:10:56.382Z\",\"stale\":false}],\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Vh9yWWbosVhyzMUwojFTNg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
