 ticket here if one exists. -->\\nhttps://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3-5417\\n\\n## Other\\n\\n<!-- Anything not covered above —>\\nThis also cleans up the previous bill waiver functionality that we had, because the discount feature was meant to replace it.\\n\\n### Backend dependency: BillDiscount purge\\n\\nThe e2e spec for the discount workflow (`e2e/specs/bill-discounts.spec.ts`) is **skipped** in this PR. The backend's `BillDiscountResource.purge` currently throws `UnsupportedOperationException`, and the `bill_discount` FK on `cashier_bill_line_item` has no `ON DELETE CASCADE`, so once a bill has a discount the e2e cleanup can't purge it — the test patient and bill leak between runs. The discount-purging helper in `e2e/commands/billing-operations.ts` is commented out for the same reason.\\n\\nA follow-up PR on `openmrs-module-billing` will add purge support for `BillDiscount` (or cascade the purge from `Bill`). Once that ships, un-skip the spec and uncomment `purgeBillDiscounts` in `deleteBill`.\",\"freshness\":[{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"lastSyncedAt\":\"2026-10-31T16:10:56.382Z\",\"stale\":false}],\"nextOffset\":null,\"truncated\":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92f654a5-a7f9-410d-93e5-f42be1f01479","uuid":"33d7eff9-6c72-4869-80fa-7ce46ab8883b","timestamp":"2026-10-31T16:24:23.406Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"repo\":\"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app\",\"number\":732,\"kind\":\"pr\",\"title\":\"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature\",\"state\":\"merged\",\"author\":\"NethmiRodrigo\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-15T11:36:32.000Z\",\"mergedAt\":\"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z\",\"closedAt\":\"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/732\",\"mergeCommit\":\"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad\",\"syncedAt\":\"2026-10-31T16:10:56.382Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"key\":\"O3-5417\",\"source\":\"ticket-pattern\"}],\"commits\":[{\"sha\":\"5127b0c031